        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet - Sigen PV 50/60/80/100/110/125M1 (Version 20260709), Sigenergy str. 2; Sigen PV (50-125)M1, Sigen PV (36-110)M1-HYA Series Installation Guide, v08 (2026-08-06) str. 7 (mere), 8-9 (Port Introduction PV / HYA), 11-14 (kabli, Table 2-1), 34 (AC L1 L2 L3 N M12, PE M8), 39-43 (PV konektorji Staubli/Amphenol, razporeditev nizov), 45-46 (COM 16-pin), 55-56 (SigenStack); C&amp;I Sigen Inverter &amp; Sigen Battery Energy Storage System User Manual (2025-09-08) str. 45 (AC stikalo PV/HYA), 48 (AC stikalo HYB grid/backup); teh_iz_ponudb (Generator ponudb SOLION) - obstoječi tehnični zapis s preseki kablov in AC stikali str. polje teh_iz_ponudb pri artiklu</elementInformation>
